# The build context is only what Dockerfile and Dockerfile.session copy, so nothing else in a
# checkout leaves the machine: .env, a GitHub App .pem, the local database, clients/*.toml,
# node_modules and .git included. Docker and flyctl upload the whole directory otherwise.
# A new COPY source in either Dockerfile needs its line here.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!tsconfig.json
!src/
!pipelines/
!workflows/
!kg/
!custom/
!session/
!docker-entrypoint.sh

# Kept out even inside the directories above.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite-*
**/node_modules
